<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Lembaga Pelesenan Kenderaan Perdagangan (Pindaan) 2024. Seksyen baharu 41a"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/44/msa@> .
